---
/**
 * Deliberately undesigned. The instrument does not run here: no HUD, no field,
 * no scroll choreography — a legal document should be readable, printable and
 * boring. Body copy still needs a pass from counsel; the [LEGAL REVIEW] markers
 * from the previous draft are carried over rather than silently resolved.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '../data/content';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy policy — Guardian Holdings JSC"
  description="What Guardian Holdings JSC collects when you write to us, why we process it, how long we keep it, and the rights you have over it."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <p class="readout">Draft · Legal review</p>
    <h1 class="h-section">Privacy policy.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      What we collect when you write to us, why we process it, how long we keep it,
      and the rights you have over it.
    </p>

    <p class="legal__notice">
      Working draft prepared for review by counsel. Statements marked [LEGAL REVIEW]
      must be confirmed or completed before this page becomes the operative policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      {COMPANY.name}, {COMPANY.street}, {COMPANY.city}, {COMPANY.country}.
      Write to <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a> about anything
      on this page.
    </p>

    <h2>What this policy covers</h2>
    <p>
      This site. It does not cover any separate agreement you sign with us, or the
      licensed investment intermediary that holds a separately managed account.
    </p>

    <h2>Data we collect</h2>
    <p>
      Only what you send us: the name, email address, stated role and message you put
      into the contact form. The form is not connected to a mailbox — it opens a draft
      in your own email client — so nothing is transmitted to us until you send it
      yourself.
    </p>

    <h2>Storage on your device</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no cookies and runs no analytics. It stores one value in
      <code>sessionStorage</code> to remember whether you switched sound on. It is
      readable only by this site and is discarded when you close the tab.
    </p>

    <h2>Why we process it, and on what basis</h2>
    <p>
      To answer you. The lawful bases are GDPR Art. 6(1)(b) — steps taken at your
      request before entering a contract — and Art. 6(1)(f), our legitimate interest
      in responding to enquiries about our business.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Correspondence: [LEGAL REVIEW] 24 months. Server logs: 30 days.</p>

    <h2>Who receives it</h2>
    <p>[LEGAL REVIEW] Our hosting provider, and no one else.</p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>[LEGAL REVIEW]</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may ask for a copy of what we hold, ask us to correct or erase it, object to
      processing, or ask us to restrict it. Write to
      <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a>. You may also complain to
      the Bulgarian Commission for Personal Data Protection, 2 Prof. Tsvetan Lazarov
      Blvd, Sofia 1592, <a href="https://cpdp.bg" rel="noreferrer">cpdp.bg</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>[LEGAL REVIEW] We will date and publish any change on this page.</p>

    <p class="legal__back"><a href="/">← Return</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(64px, 10vh, 128px) var(--gutter);
  }
  .legal h1 { margin: 16px 0 20px; }
  .legal h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.8vw, 1.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 44px 0 12px;
  }
  .legal p { font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-muted); margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .legal .lede { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .legal a { color: var(--signal-hi); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong); }
  .legal code { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .legal__notice {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--signal);
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .legal__back { margin-top: 56px; }
</style>
